  "markdown": "top of page\n\nSkip to Main Content\n\n## Brianna Soto   Sourcing Manager\n\n![Brianna.jpg](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_37f0ec6916054e23bdc01870c01c060c~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_217,y_322,w_1206,h_1640/fill/w_219,h_298,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Brianna.jpg)\n\nI bring over 15 years of professional experience in the hospitality industry with experience in operations, sales and meeting / event planning. My passion is in building lasting working relationships and providing exceptional customer service. From sourcing hotels to convention centers to many various special event venues, I thrive on providing a detailed client-focused approach in locating the ideal venue to ensure they are set up for a highly successful and memorable event.\n\nI aspire to be challenged in every aspect of my career and to keep learning and growing professionally. After growing up in a small town in New Mexico, with its country and native charm, I have grown a special love for city life now in Dallas, Texas. You can take the girl out of the country, but you can’t take the country out of the girl.\n\n[![REACH logo](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_b6659293240c40db888d813137f151bc~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_240,h_100,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Reach%20Logo%20jpg.jpg)](https://www.reachmeetings.com/)\n\nbottom of page",
