anning. My passion is in building lasting working relationships and providing exceptional customer service. From sourcing hotels to convention centers to many various special event venues, I thrive on providing a detailed client-focused approach in locating the ideal venue to ensure they are set up for a highly successful and memorable event.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\">I aspire to be challenged in every aspect of my career and to keep learning and growing professionally. After growing up in a small town in New Mexico, with its country and native charm, I have grown a special love for city life now in Dallas, Texas. You can take the girl out of the country, but you can’t take the country out of the girl.&nbsp;</p></div></div></div></section></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></main><div id=\"soapAfterPagesContainer\" class=\"soapAfterPagesContainer page-without-sosp\"><div data-mesh-id=\"soapAfterPagesContainerinlineContent\" data-testid=\"inline-content\" class=\"\"><div data-mesh-id=\"soapAfterPagesContainerinlineContent-gridContainer\" data-testid=\"mesh-container-content\"><div id=\"comp-jpe7y5rm\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div id=\"comp-k35bvj3k\" class=\"MazNVa comp-k35bvj3k wixui-image rYiAuL\"><a data-testid=\"linkElement\" href=\"https://www.reachmeetings.com/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"j7pOnl\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" id=\"img_comp-k35bvj3k\" src=\"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_b6659293240c40db888d813137f151bc~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_240,h_100,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Reach%20Logo%20jpg.jpg\" alt=\"REACH logo\" style=\"object-fit:cover\" class=\"BI8PVQ Tj01hh\" width=\"240\" height=\"100\"></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"SCROLL_TO_BOTTOM\" class=\"Vd6aQZ ignore-focus SCROLL_TO_BOTTOM\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"bottom of page\"><span class=\